					"id": 80051030,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051031
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051031,
					"content": "或许在这些已经失去理智的黑蛇骑士心中，他们依然在为守护坎瑞亚人民而战。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051032,
					"content": "将这座遗迹视为灾难中的坎瑞亚，将那些丘丘人视为正在求助的民众…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051033
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051033,
					"content": "正如我所听到的…他们口中不断嘶吼的，绝非是对他人的警告。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051034,
					"content": "那…他们说的是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051035,
					"content": "尽管已经很难辨别，但我听得出，那是古坎瑞亚语的「快逃」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051036,
						80051037
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051036,
					"content": "他们并非是在对我们说话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051038
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051038,
					"content": "就算是我也不得不承认，这份意志如此顽强，经历了五百年时光都未被磨灭…算得上是诞生自绝望的奇迹了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051039
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051039,
					"content": "那、那我不是误会他们了吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051040
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051040,
					"content": "没什么。即使是我，也有那么一瞬间将他们视为敌人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051041
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051041,
					"content": "朝着上面有光亮的地方继续前进吧，黑蛇骑士们应该不会阻止我们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051037,
					"content": "是在让身后的丘丘人快逃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051038
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051013,
					"content": "这种战斗没有意义。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051006,
					"content": "「结局」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051007
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800514,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800514
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800514",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800514,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80051401,
					"content": "欸，这个房间没有门阻挡，看来终于可以前往中间的那个房间了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051402,
					"content": "我们快过去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800515,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800515
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800515",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800515,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80051501,
					"content": "快看头顶上，居然有个水池！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051502,
					"content": "连池水都是倒置的，还真是奇景。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051503,
					"content": "你知道这个水池是怎么回事吗，戴因？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051504,
					"content": "水池似乎和整座城市是一体的，想必也是古文明的遗留物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051505,
					"content": "关键在于…我认为，削弱诅咒的效果便是来自于它。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051506,
					"content": "身处此地，躯体便会感觉到前所未有的宁静。感觉比之前更强烈了，我想多半是因为那池水有着类似「净化」的效果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051507,
					"content": "「净化」？那会不会…那个水池里的水可以彻底将诅咒净化掉呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051508,
					"content": "不可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051509,
					"content": "那么肯定？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051510,
					"content": "我保持着清醒与诅咒共存至今，已有五百年。没人比我更清楚有关诅咒的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051511,
					"content": "它是这个世界的因果级别的烙印，神明的诅咒甚至从位格上高于人类本身。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051512,
					"content": "我能感觉到，诅咒正在不断渗透我的一切，成为我的一部分，甚至逐渐「取代」我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051513,
					"content": "有限地抑制诅咒侵蚀或许还有可能，至于净化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051514,
					"content": "你就想象成直接焚毁掉身体的某一部分好了。在那之前，你甚至无法保住性命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051515,
					"content": "啊？！那不就要一命呜呼了吗！怎么会这样…无法净化的诅咒…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051516,
					"content": "从这里感受到的池水，其净化效力还差得很远。只能勉强起到一些抑制诅咒的作用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051517,
					"content": "那下面这个装置又是什么呢？好像跟周围有些格格不入…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051518,
						80051519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051518,
					"content": "莫非是深渊教团的东西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051520,
					"content": "坦白说，我也没见过这种构造的装置。你认为是深渊教团放置的，不无道理。莫非，他们是在做什么准备…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051521,
					"content": "（咔啦咔啦…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "调查"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051522,
					"content": "呜哇！吓我一跳，周围那些大门都被打开了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051523,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈夫丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051524,
					"content": "呀，是那个叫哈夫丹的骑士…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051525,
					"content": "你有话要对我说吗？哈夫丹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051526,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈夫丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051527,
					"content": "他走了…可这次不是突然消失的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051528,
					"content": "是在示意我们跟随他。如何，你们要来么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051529,
						80051530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051529,
					"content": "可能是新的线索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051531,
					"content": "说的也是…那…我们走吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051530,
					"content": "他应该对我们没有恶意了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051519,
					"content": "可能是深渊教团的秘密了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051520
					]
				}
			]
		},
